    "Line_No": 12,
    "Speaker": "竹本 (Gidayū Narrator)",
    "Japanese_Ruby": "<ruby>表裏一度<rt>おもてうらいちど</rt></ruby>に<ruby>手筈<rt>てはず</rt></ruby>を<ruby>極<rt>き</rt></ruby>め、<ruby>矢間<rt>やざま</rt></ruby>・<ruby>千崎<rt>せんざき</rt></ruby>、<ruby>不敵<rt>ふてき</rt></ruby>の<ruby>二人<rt>ふたり</rt></ruby>、<ruby>表門<rt>おもてもん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>忍<rt>しの</rt></ruby>び<ruby>寄<rt>よ</rt></ruby>り、<ruby>内<rt>うち</rt></ruby>の<ruby>様子<rt>ようす</rt></ruby>を<ruby>窺<rt>うかが</rt></ruby>えば、<ruby>夜回<rt>よまわ</rt></ruby>りと<ruby>思<rt>おぼ</rt></ruby>しき<ruby>拍子木<rt>ひょうしぎ</rt></ruby>、<ruby>遠音<rt>とおね</rt></ruby>をさせば よき<ruby>折<rt>おり</rt></ruby>と、<ruby>例<rt>れい</rt></ruby>のたしなむ<ruby>継<rt>つ</rt></ruby>ぎ<ruby>梯子<rt>はしご</rt></ruby>、<ruby>高塀<rt>たかべい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>打<rt>う</rt></ruby>ちかけ<ruby>打<rt>う</rt></ruby>ちかけ、<ruby>雲居<rt>くもい</rt></ruby>までもと、ささがにの、<ruby>登<rt>のぼ</rt></ruby>りおおせた<ruby>塀<rt>へい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>屋根<rt>やね</rt></ruby>。",
    "Japanese_Plain": "表裏一度に手筈を極め、矢間・千崎、不敵の二人、表門に忍び寄り、内の様子を窺えば、夜回りと思しき拍子木、遠音をさせば よき折と、例のたしなむ継ぎ梯子、高塀に打ちかけ打ちかけ、雲居までもと、ささがにの、登りおおせた塀の屋根。",
    "English": "Coordinating front and back at once, bold Yazama and Senzaki creep up to the main gate and listen inside. As the night-watchman's clappers fade into the distance, they seize their chance, prop the jointed scaling ladder against the high wall, and—nimble as spiders climbing toward the clouds—scale straight onto the tiled wall-top.",
    "Notes": "",
