    "Line_No": 13,
    "Speaker": "竹本 (Gidayū Narrator)",
    "Japanese_Ruby": "<ruby>早<rt>はや</rt></ruby>、<ruby>拍子木<rt>ひょうしぎ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>近<rt>ちか</rt></ruby>づく<ruby>音<rt>おと</rt></ruby>、ひらりと<ruby>降<rt>お</rt></ruby>りるを<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>つけし<ruby>番人<rt>ばんにん</rt></ruby>、「スハ <ruby>何者<rt>なにもの</rt></ruby>！」とかけ<ruby>寄<rt>よ</rt></ruby>るを、<ruby>取<rt>と</rt></ruby>ってひっ<ruby>伏<rt>ふ</rt></ruby>せ、<ruby>高手小手<rt>たかてこて</rt></ruby>。「よい<ruby>案内<rt>あんない</rt></ruby>」と<ruby>息<rt>いき</rt></ruby>を<ruby>止<rt>と</rt></ruby>め、<ruby>縄先腰<rt>なわさきこし</rt></ruby>に<ruby>引<rt>ひ</rt></ruby>っかけて、<ruby>拍子木奪<rt>ひょうしぎうば</rt></ruby>い、カッチカチ。<ruby>役所役所<rt>やくしょやくしょ</rt></ruby>をうち<ruby>回<rt>まわ</rt></ruby>り<ruby>窺<rt>うかが</rt></ruby>い<ruby>回<rt>まわ</rt></ruby>るぞ、<ruby>不敵<rt>ふてき</rt></ruby>なる。",
    "Japanese_Plain": "早、拍子木の近づく音、ひらりと降りるを見つけし番人、「スハ 何者！」とかけ寄るを、取ってひっ伏せ、高手小手。「よい案内」と息を止め、縄先腰に引っかけて、拍子木奪い、カッチカチ。役所役所をうち回り窺い回るぞ、不敵なる。",
    "English": "Soon the watchman's clappers draw near; spotting them leap lightly down, he cries, 'Hey—who goes there?!' Instantly they pin him flat and truss him hand and foot, gagging him as a convenient guide, tuck the rope to their belts, snatch his clappers—clack, clack!—and boldly patrol past guardhouse after guardhouse to scout the mansion.",
    "Notes": "",
    "Source": "https://kininaruart.com/artist/chusingura/c11.html",
    "Staging": "performed"
