    "Japanese_Plain": "「元より、両隣、仁木・石堂殿へ何の遺恨も候わねば、卒爾致さん様も無し。火の用心は堅く申し付けたれば、これ以って御用心に及ばぬ事。ただ穩便に捨て置かれよ。それとても隣家の事、聞き捨てならず加勢あらば、力なく一矢仕らん」と、高声に答へたり。",
    "English": "'From the first we have borne no grudge against our neighbours on either side, the lords Niki and Ishidō, and we shall commit no rudeness toward them. We have given strict orders to guard against fire, so you need have no fear on that score. We ask only that you leave us be. But if, as neighbours, you cannot ignore this and come to Moronō's aid, then we shall have no choice but to loose an arrow against you,' he answers in a ringing voice.",
